WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:06.931
I was a Christian, but I
only came to complete surrender

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:10.320
when my dad, my father,
was about to die.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.478
He was abiding in Christ,
he fully surrendered.

00:00:15.478 --> 00:00:18.656
Because he loved
Jesus Christ!

00:00:18.995 --> 00:00:22.751
You see you need to follow God
in everything you do.

00:00:22.751 --> 00:00:25.904
To fully surrender&nbsp;
to Him.

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:29.801
This book is close to my heart,
and I wrote it for men

00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:33.148
who are really seeking
the heart of&nbsp;God.

00:00:33.148 --> 00:00:35.958
Who wants to grow in Him,
who want to abide in Him.

00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:39.672
Have you fully
surrendered to Christ?

00:00:40.717 --> 00:00:44.867
Or is there one or two things
that you're still holding back?

00:00:51.871 --> 00:00:55.983
Are you a doer of the word&nbsp;
and not just a hearer?

